{"des":"雪原中的阴影-文艺系学生阿莱琳娜互动","script":"s_5_5_3","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]几位……真的对不起……我……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没事，你冷静点慢慢说吧。旅舍的老板已经联系院卫，把那些混蛋带走了。就算还有人盯着你，我们几个也会保护好你的。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]真的非常感谢三位，还有——斯坎达？你要去哪里？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那个……有事情你们讨论就好。我刚刚丢了大脸……没资格参与你们之间的对话了……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你给我回来！明明是你开的头，还想就这么逃了？刚刚你扔铁坨子砸我头的事还没了呢！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我……我我我……我回来就是了……回来就是了。[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是斯坎达请这三位来救我的吧，真的非常感谢你们……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没有……没有……我只是做了一些比蚂蚁还小的事情而已……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]别听这胆小鬼胡说，是他看出你遇到困难才让我们来问你的。阿莱琳娜，事已至此，你这事我们可没法装没看见了。摊上什么事了，赶紧说吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没错。放任你在这里做这种事，无论是你还是其他人，都会受到无法治愈的伤害的。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……事情是这样的……刚才那些人是哈萨琳之手的佣兵，我在他们的胁迫下到街上招揽客人。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哈萨琳之手？！那群家伙也来到霜烬平原了吗？！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]唔……这个名字我听过。听说他们是从北边的山里来的……他们好像受不了这里的风雪，活动都有一阵没一阵的……[l]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_16","text":"听起来像魔物一样。"},{"tag":"tag_16","text":"阿莱琳娜，然后呢？"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]唔……我把客人带到房间里之后，如果对方同意，那我就好好“服务”对方，让对方交一大笔钱。如果对方不同意，那门外的佣兵就冲进来强行让对方交钱。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]居然还有这种事情……[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怎么都能要到一笔钱……只能说不愧是哈萨琳之手，只有他们才能做出这种缺德事！不过你是被抓住什么把柄了吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……准确来说并不是我的把柄，是我老爸的把柄。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我老爸目前在做研究，但因为没有经费不得已向他们借了高利贷。眼下他们来催债，但我们手上一分钱都没有……所以我和老爸在他们的威胁下……被迫做了很多违心之事……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么！这也太过分了！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不……旅舍里的那几个不过是走狗罢了，真正的幕后黑手远在大书院之外……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那、那就带我去找他们！居然敢这样欺负阿莱琳娜！必须要让他们付出代价！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]斯坎达……谢谢你。但这是我的家事，而且整件事确实是我的老爸有错在先。请让我们自己解决这些问题吧……[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怎么能独自解决！难道还要让你继续配合那群佣兵，在大街上搔首弄姿、败坏自己的名声吗？绝对不行！[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哇……没想到你也会有这么强硬的时候……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……我知道啦，你不要这么凶了，这和你平常的样子也差太多了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]对不起……但我实在不忍心看你被那群佣兵玩弄于股掌之间……[l][cm]","charaName":"匠艺系学生斯坎达"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你就放心吧。还有我们呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我明白了……有几位相助，也许真的可能有所转机。但如果真要找他们的话，我们得赶快。如果刚才旅舍里的事情传出去，他们可能会对老爸不利。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]他们的营地就在沉星冰湖东部，如果我没猜错的话，老爸现在应该还在那边给他们打零工还债。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生阿莱琳娜"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]既然这样，我们就赶快出发吧！不能让阿莱琳娜的老爸出事！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}